        <p class="text-text-secondary text-center">Stay on top of your deadlines and achieve your goals faster with smart reminders and progress tracking.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="bg-bg p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg border border-border">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-16 h-16 bg-accent rounded-full mb-6 mx-auto">
